---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description =
	'Read our privacy policy: information we collect, analytics usage, cookies, third-party services, data retention, and user rights.';
const canonical = 'https://airfryerconverter.com/privacy-policy/';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-10 md:py-14">
		<section class="bg-canvas-soft rounded-3xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-10">
			<h1 class="font-display text-display-xl tracking-[-2.4px] text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>

			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				This Privacy Policy explains how Air Fryer Converter (“we”, “our”, “us”) collects, uses, and shares information when you use our
				oven to air fryer conversion calculator, conversion charts, and related content.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Information We Collect</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				We collect information you provide directly to us. Depending on how you use the site, this may include:
			</p>
			<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7 list-disc pl-5">
				<li>Usage data (pages viewed, interactions, and general device information)</li>
				<li>Browser and approximate location information (based on IP-derived data)</li>
				<li>Technical logs required to operate the site</li>
				<li>Any information you choose to include when contacting us</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Analytics Usage</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				We may use analytics tools such as Google Analytics and other services to understand how visitors use the site. These tools help us
				improve performance, content usefulness, and overall user experience.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Cookies</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Cookies are small files stored on your device. They can be used to remember preferences, enable features, and measure performance.
				You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect some site functionality.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Third-Party Services</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				We may use third-party services that help us operate the site. Examples include analytics and search-related tools (such as Google
				Search Console). These third parties may collect information relevant to their services and may use cookies or similar technologies.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Data Retention</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				We retain information for as long as needed to provide the service, analyze performance, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes,
				and enforce agreements. Retention periods vary depending on the type of data.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">User Rights</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Depending on your location, you may have rights related to your personal data, including:
			</p>
			<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7 list-disc pl-5">
				<li>Request access to your personal data</li>
				<li>Request correction or deletion</li>
				<li>Object to or restrict certain processing</li>
				<li>Request data portability where applicable</li>
				<li>Withdraw consent where consent is the legal basis for processing</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Contact Information</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us using the information listed on the Contact Us page.
				You can also reach us at: <strong>routevanii@gmail.com</strong>.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-5">
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					<strong>Note:</strong> This Privacy Policy is provided for transparency. For legal compliance, consider consulting a qualified legal
					professional.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-12">
		<div class="mt-6 text-sm text-body">
			Prefer to reach out directly? Visit <a class="underline" href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a>.
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
